  "description": "Battery 21 at its position, seen from its PU-12M (roadmap G10.8). The combat order plans a march at 01:00: the battery commander gives «К маршу!» on the battery net, each vehicle commander reads it back and reports «к маршу готов» once out; 23, its set off, is rung on the field telephone. The radiotelephonist writes each reply in the journal. At the end of the route «К бою!» goes down the column by flags and each vehicle reports «к бою готов». The NPC battery commander does it unless you take his seat: then the orders are yours (the crew menu's Battery orders sector; the helper shows them when they are due).",
